lass=\"strong\">Bruce</span>:  Thanks. You ought to try the roast beef next time. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  How can I help you, Bruce?", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: The night shift next week is from 10:00 p.m. to 2:00 a.m. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Oh yes, that's the graveyard shift. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: I want to follow up on our meeting last week.  I recommended staying open until 4:00 a.m., but it can get very busy around midnight. I want to make sure we don't have staffing problems. Sometimes we run into problems when we are short staffed.", "time": "21500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I wouldn't worry about it. We set up the work schedule already.  We have three servers, two bus people, a kitchen manager, a soup and sauce cook and a ma\u00eetre d'. Isn't that enough?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: I would hire more staff. That would be very helpful.  You could always add a sous chef and maybe a bartender. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It might turn out to be a good idea. I'll fill you in tomorrow about my decision. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: Ok, thanks.", "time": "45000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}